 395:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      * The floating point math for conversion is:
 396:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      *  valueto = valuefrom * ( (2^bitsto - 1) / (float)(2^bitsfrom - 1) )
 397:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      * The faster integer math for conversion is:
 398:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      *  valueto = ( valuefrom * multiplier + adder ) >> divisor
 399:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      *   multiplier = FLOOR( ( (2^bitsto - 1) << divisor ) / (float)(2^bitsfrom - 1) )
 400:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      *
 401:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      * Find the first divisor where ( adder >> divisor ) <= 0
 402:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      *
 403:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      * 5-bit to 8-bit: ( 31 * multiplier + adder ) >> divisor = 255
 404:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      * divisor  multiplier  adder  min (0)  max (31)
 405:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      *       0           8      7        7       255
 406:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      *       1          16     14        7       255
 407:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/sw/../../misc/lv_color.h ****      *       2          32     28        7       255
